<===> non_normalized/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@use "sass:string";
@include meta.load-css("other", $with: (string.unquote("\\24"): override));

<===> non_normalized/_other.scss
$\$: original !default;
a {b: $\$}

<===> non_normalized/error
Error: $\24 was not declared with !default in the @used module.
  ,
3 | @include meta.load-css("other", $with: (string.unquote("\\24"): override));
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 3:1  root stylesheet

