<===> dash_insensitive/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@use "sass:string";
@include meta.load-css("other", $with: (string.unquote("a\\5f b"): override));

<===> dash_insensitive/_other.scss
$a-b: original !default;
c {d: $a-b}

<===> dash_insensitive/error
Error: $a\5f b was not declared with !default in the @used module.
  ,
3 | @include meta.load-css("other", $with: (string.unquote("a\\5f b"): override));
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 3:1  root stylesheet

